{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0403_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2d291448cc54cbf08bc3549ba71638ef80a4cab2c5b5eb642be66137702584ff", "ja": "（紗代子たちのライブは大成功だった。特にポーズを\nきめた瞬間の大声援は、本当にすごかったな……）", "zh": "（纱代子她们的演出大获成功。尤其是在摆出姿势的那一刻，现场响起的巨大欢呼声，真的太惊人了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0403_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "2512a90ecb0953334fd828e25fda452ece587ae043c4b81d5e3a3777252aa742", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}。\nお疲れさまです！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。\n辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0403_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5751748f4cdeeafc49f55bf83222439451aeea4dc299c1c18f13ed484be9dea4", "ja": "お疲れさま……って、あれ？\n今日はオフじゃなかったか……？", "zh": "辛苦了……咦？\n今天不是休息日吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0403_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "3ca5ff1d004a6c19801f9b0b95203aaad8ebf76ed565aceece47cbf265560804", "ja": "そうだったんですけど、\nライブの熱気がまだ体から消えなくて……。", "zh": "本来是这样的，不过演唱会的热情还没有从身体里消退……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0403_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "baf271fda748629c0bf729d21618ba839e1a82282eb500a545a41cd07c36504b", "ja": "ちょっとだけ散歩するつもりが、\n気づいたら劇場まで来ちゃってました。", "zh": "本来只是想稍微散散步，回过神来却已经走到剧场了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0403_1005_p", "source_sha256": "424a74b8b5e0f12624bee2d6ad94a7a1e6f5bfbf5d1f349c81974cb079bbdeda", "ja": "興奮さめやらぬってやつか。\nライブの余韻がまだ残ってるんだな。", "zh": "这就是所谓的兴奋劲儿还没过去吧。演出的余韵还留在心里呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0403_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "068fc729c6f73af8eab351ed12246dc62d01918ac457aacdc9ceeae958a5fdad", "ja": "そうですね。今、思い出してもドキドキしてます！\n声が波みたいに押し寄せてくるあの感じ……。", "zh": "是啊。现在回想起来，还是会心跳加速！\n那种如同歌声化作波浪般一阵阵涌来的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0403_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "201f8976fe6e2c1302fb0f33c011a41f777aff311329b1dfc91b45bbb12907a7", "ja": "みんなの喜びが伝わってきて、\nステージの上で体が震えて……本当に夢のようでした。", "zh": "大家的喜悦传递了过来，站在舞台上，身体都在颤抖……真的就像做梦一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0403_1008_p", "source_sha256": "b799ff90a989119cfd5fc53b243860a61d19f9a822d67d076c471ae776ac3ab0", "ja": "ああ、紗代子が感動してるのはわかったよ。\n袖で見てても、震えてるなって……。", "zh": "啊，我知道纱代子很感动。\n就算在侧台看着，也能看出你在发抖……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0403_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "8814b7b36bd614baeb6f5645aab7b9e4a9d3c1c40f4cd738b773c37824b6e83d", "ja": "えっ！　そ、そうなんですか……。\nううっ。なんだか恥ずかしいな……。でも……", "zh": "诶！是、是这样吗……  \n呜呜，总觉得有点不好意思……不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0403_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "5ff363025cce35b6145e17f66bd774ca87b6f49ba055c3d6814e206539e873e6", "ja": "私、あの声援が、本当に嬉しかったんです。\n私の思いが、みんなに届いたんだなって。", "zh": "我真的很高兴收到那些加油声。\n让我感觉到，我的心意传达给大家了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0403_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "ad8fb979262dd1abcba337cd3fe39fea938e9c0a494107d83b9135f834961e64", "ja": "それがわかって、また嬉しくて……。\n今度は、私がお返しする番ですね。", "zh": "知道这一点后，我又感到好开心……这次轮到我来回报大家了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0403_1012_p", "source_sha256": "1f2cc6be46358aa57b50307dce58ad97eb1cc7fef3257e486e41383e19f11538", "ja": "そうだな。ファンのみんなも待ってると思う。\nでも、その前に……！", "zh": "是啊。我想粉丝们也都在等着呢。不过，在那之前……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0403_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "b6149a1d5c5b1d58e46bd5e8d3d865cd330166544d1ce6e7e59a0a7b4ca5de21", "ja": "ふふっ。わかってます、{$P$}。\nちゃんと休めってことですよね。", "zh": "呵呵，我明白的，{$P$}。\n是要我好好休息，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0403_1014_027say", "source_sha256": "0e7fd9ac15b68016f77ef1ff798f92379011a9555cec910a5acb3c12ceeb7ef3", "ja": "もっともっとみんなを笑顔にするために！\n私、帰りますね。お仕事、頑張ってください！", "zh": "为了让大家绽放更多更多的笑容！\n那我先回去了。工作加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
